"be used.\n"
"In native mode, Quarkus supports the following versions: `6.2.x`, `7.0.x`, "
"`7.1.x`, `7.2.x`, `7.3.x`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For version `7.4.x` and `7.5.x`, due to an issue with the Confluent Schema "
"Serializer, you need to add another dependency:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
